    "uncertain",
    "whisper_doubt"
   ],
   "notes": "Zentradi language. Heard 'esukesuto intaa fo dezantsu deburarido karaa aruma zentoran horuto gadora'. The end, 'Arma Zentran, holt gadora', is Boddole Zer's attack order in Do You Remember Love? (Yahoo Chiebukuro q11102066796: 'all Zentradi forces, begin the attack'). Zentradi words from the film's lexicon (ja.wikipedia 'Zentradi' language section; gansaito1.hatenablog.jp 2016-09-14 word list): esekes = understand (imperative), fo = future, de-zants = perish, deburan = enemy, arma = all, zentran = Zentradi man, gadoras = battle/attack. 'inta', 'rido' and 'karaa' are not in the lexicon; the middle is a gist."
  },
